		pellets = 1,
		ability = "goldRush",
		goldRushBonus = 150,
		-- A cannon fires shells (#122). Small on purpose: 12 at the centre over a 5-stud radius, so the
		-- struck player's body shot plus the blast (both x CombatDamageScale) still comes to about 96
